  <notes>
    COMPLETED 2026-10-03. Record: notes/076-record-numbering.md.
    Owner decisions 2026-10-02/03: Dataverse platform autonumber MAT-/PRJ-{SEQNUM:6}, INTERIM ("until we build the
    numbering function"); blank rows backfilled on first run; dev apply approved after the dry run; ADR-002 WP-1 conflict
    resolved as path A now (spec ADR Tensions) + path B as task 087.
    Dev: scripts/Set-RecordNumberingSchema.ps1 applied (sprk_MatterNumber key created; 7 nameless wizard projects now
    PRJ-000001..007); -Verify PASS. Live through the deployed BFF: pane matter/project numbered; 6 concurrent creates got
    6 distinct numbers; the To Do regarding lookup that was blank shows the number; a supplied wizard number is kept; a
    typed-ahead collision is refused 0x80060892 and the next attempt gets the next number. Test rows deleted.
    BFF: never sends the number; retries only a key-refused create (3 attempts, then 409 record_number_unavailable);
    reads the number back and warns if blank; a failed or cancelled read never fails a committed create.
    Gates: touched classes 78/78; seeds caught 3/1/2 + W3 2; full suite 14,217 passed / 1 failed (pre-existing
    PinnedMemory metrics-tag flake, passes alone 15/15) / 54 skipped; ArchTests 345/345; publish +981 B (212 = 212
    files); no vulnerable packages. Step 9.5: code review (W1-W4 fixed, W5 = the ADR conflict, W6 fixed) and adr-check
    (V-1 resolved by owner, W-2/W-3/W-6 fixed) — notes §9.
    Open: run the script in every other environment (production after the owner's uniqueness check); the BFF's retry and
    warning run live with the next deploy from master.
  </notes>
